    <entry_item>
      <dico>Boberg</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠠᠮᠺᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>qamkiqu</uighur>
      <definition>v.t. To close (door, book etc.). to lock. To fit seams together. To join a crack.</definition>
      <page>532</page>
